{"5217110":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"‌Tidy Up the Bookstore","steam_appid":5217110,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a large bookstore that was once beloved but is now in disarray. 4,018 unique books are scattered across shelves, counters, and every corner; they belong to 410 series and await their return to 82 bookshelves. Your task is to restore order and peace to this forgotten bookstore.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time to sort, place, and return each book to the correct shelf. Move among countless bookcases, find misplaced volumes, and carefully put each one back in its place. There is no forced countdown and no stressful rush; you can tidy at your own pace, or learn various abilities and use strategy to optimize categorization and movement routes, making the tidying smoother and smoother.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the calm and peaceful atmosphere and watch the bookstore gradually become neat and pleasant from chaos. Enjoy that deep sense of satisfaction and healing—watching every row of shelves become perfectly neat, one book after another.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a large bookstore that was once beloved but is now in disarray. 4,018 unique books are scattered across shelves, counters, and every corner; they belong to 410 series and await their return to 82 bookshelves. Your task is to restore order and peace to this forgotten bookstore.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time to sort, place, and return each book to the correct shelf. Move among countless bookcases, find misplaced volumes, and carefully put each one back in its place. There is no forced countdown and no stressful rush; you can tidy at your own pace, or learn various abilities and use strategy to optimize categorization and movement routes, making the tidying smoother and smoother.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the calm and peaceful atmosphere and watch the bookstore gradually become neat and pleasant from chaos. Enjoy that deep sense of satisfaction and healing—watching every row of shelves become perfectly neat, one book after another.<\/p>","short_description":"Tidy Up the Bookstore is a relaxing organization sim. Return 4,018 unique books from 410 series to 82 shelves. Learn abilities and use strategy to tidy faster while enjoying calm, satisfying order.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Russian, Turkish, Japanese, Polish, Korean, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5217110\/9a8c2fd15c36e6b263cd8f397a03be5483dd7686\/header.jpg?t=1793729602","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5217110\/e2f130f3dd04b2e645194823afba7e56b75f063f\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793729602","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5217110\/e2f130f3dd04b2e645194823afba7e56b75f063f\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793729602","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-10300H<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-14900KF<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 64 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["BombGame"],"publishers":["BombGame"],